# Direct abs-symbolic-coefficient composition.
# Run: cargo run --release -- -strict -lang en -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_strategy/abs_symbolic_factor.lit
# Historical explicit proof:
# claim:
#     ? forall a R+,x R:
#         abs(a*x)=a*abs(x)
#     abs(a)=a
#     abs(a*x)=abs(a)*abs(x)=a*abs(x)
# Boundary: all original domains and premises are required.
forall a R+,x R:
    abs(a*x)=a*abs(x)
